WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.705 --> 00:00:11.037
This page shows the official course learning outcomes and the Ontario employability skills behind every week, so you can always see why the work exists.

2
00:00:11.037 --> 00:00:21.931
Read the outcomes as promises. Each one names something you will be able to do by the end. They are the same for every student on every route through the course.

3
00:00:21.931 --> 00:00:30.335
Use the week buttons. Each outcome lists the weeks that build it. If an outcome feels shaky, those weeks are where to go.

4
00:00:30.335 --> 00:00:38.929
Check the assessment lines. Each outcome names the assessments that measure it, so no graded task ever comes out of nowhere.

5
00:00:38.929 --> 00:00:49.751
Notice the skills employers name. The Essential Employability Skills list is what Ontario colleges promise every graduate. This course practises the ones shown.

6
00:00:49.751 --> 00:00:54.747
Nothing here is graded. Blackboard carries the official documents.

7
00:00:54.747 --> 00:00:59.557
Where next: Open a week one of your shakier outcomes points at.
